#2601
doorwarden dustman warden traveler~
the Dustman doorwarden~
A weathered traveler in dusty boots leans on a staff beside a narrow doorway.
~
Her face is brown and lined from years of sun and wind, and her boots
are so caked with the dust of a hundred roads that their original color
is anyone's guess.  A battered compass hangs from a thong around her
neck.  She keeps the door of the Dustmen's hall, and she has a way of
looking at strangers as though measuring how far they have come and how
far they will get.
~
