#2602
steward harmonium guard keeper~
the Harmonium steward~
A calm man in a plain blue robe stands before a modest bluestone doorway.
~
He wears a robe of undyed wool, bleached and patched, with only a
knotted blue cord at his wrist to mark his order.  He owns nothing he
could not give away in a moment, and it shows in his easy, unhurried
calm.  He greets passers-by politely, but he does not step aside for
anyone who is not one of the Harmonium.
~
