#2603
sashbearer mercykiller youth guard~
the Mercykiller sashbearer~
A sharply dressed young swordsman lounges against a freshly painted doorway.
~
He cannot be more than twenty, and he is dressed in the very latest
fashion, from the slashed sleeves of his doublet to the polished toes of
his boots.  A sash of bright green silk is knotted at his hip, beside a
rapier that has seen more use than its owner's age would suggest.  He
smiles easily, and the smile never reaches his eyes.
~
