#2604
bowsinger xaositect elf archer guard~
the Xaositect bowsinger~
A slender elf with a longbow across her back stands among the trees, humming softly.
~
She is tall and fine-boned, with hair the color of autumn leaves bound
back by a cord of braided grass.  A tiny silver leaf hangs from her left
ear, and a longbow of pale wood is slung across her back.  She hums an
old Tarmirnae melody under her breath, and though her eyes are half
closed, you have the distinct feeling she has already marked every step
you have taken.
~
