#2605
lamplighter sign guard paladin~
the Lamplighter of the Sign~
A paladin in white and gold stands before a marble doorway, a lantern at his belt.
~
His armor is enameled white and trimmed with gold, and not a speck of
dirt mars it anywhere.  A golden ankh of Glasgian hangs at his breast,
and a small brass lantern burns at his belt even in broad daylight, for
the Sign of One holds that no shadow should ever be suffered to fall on
its door.
~
