#2606
blackblade doomguard knight guard~
the Doomguard blackblade~
A knight in black-enameled plate stands before an onyx doorway, his blade bared.
~
Every plate of his armor has been enameled black, and the only
decoration on it is the symbol of Cair, God of War, picked out in dull
red on the breastplate.  He holds his greatsword bare and point-down
before him, both hands resting on the pommel.  The Doomguard believe
that war is the only honest prayer, and he looks as though he would
welcome a chance to pray.
~
