#2607
warden fraternity knight justice guard~
the Fraternity warden~
A stern knight in whitestone-gray plate guards a door set into the city wall.
~
His armor is plain, gray and spotless, and a white rune of justice is
painted on his shield.  He is old for a knight still in service, his
close-cropped hair gone iron gray, but he stands as straight as a spear.
The knights of the Fraternity of Order serve Malachi, God of Justice,
and he watches the passers-by with the patient attention of a man who
has heard every excuse there is.
~
