#2608
tallyman athar thief guard~
the Athar tallyman~
A thin man with ink-stained fingers sits on a crate beside a trapdoor, counting coins.
~
He is narrow-shouldered and sallow, with quick, ink-stained fingers that
never stop moving: counting coins, stacking them, sweeping them into a
purse and starting again.  A tiny gold coin is tattooed beneath his left
eye.  The Athar hold that everything has a price, and from the way he
looks you over, he is already working out yours.
~
