#2609
silent one believer assassin guard~
a Silent One~
A figure wrapped in black silk crouches motionless in the shadows of the alley.
~
You can make out very little of the figure beyond a wrapping of black
silk and the gleam of two dark eyes.  It does not speak and does not
move, and if not for those eyes you might take it for a heap of rags.
The Believers of the Source guard their door with silence, and with the
long, thin knife you only now notice resting across its knees.
~
