#2610
adept transcendent mage guard~
the Transcendent adept~
A young mage in white robes stands before a slender tower, a blue flame in her palm.
~
Her robes are spotless white, and the palm of her right hand has been
dyed a pure, chalky white.  A small blue flame dances in that palm,
casting no heat but lighting her face from below.  The Transcendent
Order teaches that magic is a gift to be used for others, and she
regards visitors with friendly curiosity, though the runes of warding on
the tower door glow a little brighter whenever she frowns.
~
