#2611
hexer fated warlock guard~
the Fated hexer~
A gaunt warlock in black robes stands before a door of black stone, smiling thinly.
~
He is pale and gaunt, with sunken cheeks and long, yellowed fingernails,
and the palm of his left hand is stained a deep, inky black.  Runes
drawn in something dark and dried cover the sleeves of his robe.  The
Fated believe that power belongs to whoever is ruthless enough to take
it, and the warlock studies you the way a butcher studies a side of
beef.
~
